@dhayab i have tried making your example work with multiple indexes but resultsByIndex always contains data for indexName added on the `<InstantSearch indexName="test_inject_content">` and not the `<Index indexName="test_product">.`

```
getHits: ({ position, resultsByIndex }) => {
     const index = position / 5;
     const item =
         resultsByIndex.instant_search &&
          resultsByIndex.instant_search.hits[index];

     return item ? [item] : [];
},
```

Any help here would be appreciated!
